name: Sprott P
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case P) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 2.7 [1.5, 4]
param b = 1.0 [0.5, 2]

dx = a*y + z
dy = -x + y^2
dz = x + b*y
